<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$167 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$167 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bevy of promissory note issuers came to the Australian commercial paper market on Monday for a total of A$167 million.</p>
<p>Dealers said maturities caused the surge in issuance which contrasted with traditional market topor in the lead up the Christmas holiday.</p>
<p>The physical bank bill yield curve has steepened slightly from its pre-weekend levels and at 0120 GMT (12.20 p.m.) March bank bill futures were up one point to 94.13.</p>
